From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000083 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 17:47:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-1-0083: enable exact path/text candidate replay

Consume the immutable holder-space candidate index only for complete parsed
path/text RenderPrograms. Validate command identity before drawing, preserve
painter order, and dispatch each survivor through canonical PDFium
RenderSingleObject semantics.

Wire the executor into synchronous holder and progressive root rendering with
bounded 262144-command query storage and per-command cancellation. Dense,
unsupported, stale, partial, and stop-object renders fall back before drawing.

Invalidate holder-owned RenderProgram metadata in O(1) when an owned page
object changes dirty, matrix, active, or bounds state so parse-time spatial
bounds can never cull edited live geometry.
